      "content": "it's not just the house though. it's everything. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person anymore, just a shadow. there's this strange peace in thinking about everything just... stopping. like, if the silence finally took me, wouldn't it be more beautiful than this constant, heavy ache? like a poem that just ends instead of dragging on forever.",
